WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.973 --> 00:00:12.839
The morning bugle call was echoing through camp.

2
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.321
Ivy groaned as she opened her eyes.

3
00:00:17.561 --> 00:00:21.824
Willow and Clara were already up, making their beds before morning inspection.

4
00:00:22.604 --> 00:00:24.205
Penelope was wide awake too.

5
00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:27.127
"Let's talk about the talent show next week, girls!

6
00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:28.708
Come on, Ivy."

7
00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.489
Ivy dragged herself out of bed.

8
00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.612
The three younger girls gathered around Penelope.

9
00:00:36.632 --> 00:00:40.834
"Each cabin usually does an act together," Penelope said.

10
00:00:40.854 --> 00:00:44.916
"It would be great if She smiled hopefully at them.

11
00:00:44.936 --> 00:00:47.317
"You three did something together."

12
00:00:47.337 --> 00:00:50.559
"Ugh!" Ivy thought.

13
00:00:50.579 --> 00:00:53.441
"Another group activity."

14
00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:56.702
Clara shot a nervous glance at Ivy.

15
00:00:56.722 --> 00:00:58.723
"That sounds fun."

16
00:01:00.308 --> 00:01:02.449
"Great!" Penelope beamed.

17
00:01:02.469 --> 00:01:04.649
"I have to go help with breakfast.

18
00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:07.470
I know you'll come up with an awesome act for the show.

19
00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:09.070
See you later!"

20
00:01:15.312 --> 00:01:17.393
any ideas for an act we can do together?"

21
00:01:17.813 --> 00:01:18.593
Clara asked.

22
00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:20.393
Ivy shrugged.

23
00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.554
"Are you guys good at drawing vampires?"

24
00:01:25.275 --> 00:01:29.376
"Um. That's not really a talent show act," Clara said.

25
00:01:30.584 --> 00:01:31.364
"But never mind.

26
00:01:32.245 --> 00:01:33.605
We have time to think of something."

27
00:01:34.785 --> 00:01:35.505
Willow nodded.

28
00:01:35.525 --> 00:01:38.086
"We're going to volleyball this morning.

29
00:01:39.406 --> 00:01:40.547
You should come too, Ivy.

30
00:01:41.187 --> 00:01:43.287
We could plan our act between the games."

31
00:01:43.308 --> 00:01:46.628
"Oh—um, sorry!"

32
00:01:47.129 --> 00:01:47.649
Ivy said.

33
00:01:47.669 --> 00:01:51.430
"I promised Ezra and Glen I'd go hiking with them."

34
00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.571
Ivy tried not to look happy about having an excuse.

35
00:01:56.511 --> 00:01:59.672
She needed some time apart from her cabinmates to think of a plan.

36
00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.141
There was no way she was doing an act with them.

37
00:02:03.161 --> 00:02:06.382
"Okay," Clara said.

38
00:02:06.402 --> 00:02:09.903
"But let's meet back here later to discuss it.

39
00:02:10.783 --> 00:02:12.103
It'll be such a blast!"

40
00:02:13.224 --> 00:02:16.484
"You mean, it'll be such a nightmare," Ivy thought.

41
00:02:17.805 --> 00:02:21.006
Ivy, Glen, and Ezra walked along the trail with the other hikers.

42
00:02:22.326 --> 00:02:24.207
Mango was looking through his binoculars.

43
00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:28.988
"I really want to spot a painted lady butterfly.

44
00:02:29.724 --> 00:02:31.265
I haven't seen one all summer."

45
00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:35.809
The Ucks were practicing football tackles and bumping into everyone.

46
00:02:35.829 --> 00:02:39.212
"What's up with this talent show?"

47
00:02:39.733 --> 00:02:40.333
Ivy asked.

48
00:02:40.353 --> 00:02:43.916
"Penelope said we have to do an act with our cabin.

49
00:02:44.657 --> 00:02:48.520
If I have to be in a talent show, I'd rather do something alone.

50
00:02:49.641 --> 00:02:50.842
Or maybe with you guys."

51
00:02:50.862 --> 00:02:54.605
"Of course you would rather do an act with me!"

52
00:02:55.025 --> 00:02:55.646
Glen said.

53
00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:58.108
"I'm amazingly talented!

54
00:02:58.824 --> 00:03:01.105
And I know everything about this camp!"

55
00:03:02.326 --> 00:03:03.046
Ezra shrugged.

56
00:03:03.066 --> 00:03:07.409
"The talent show is something cabinmates always do together."

57
00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:09.990
Ivy gritted her teeth.

58
00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:13.352
"Another activity I'm forced to do.

59
00:03:14.593 --> 00:03:15.733
What's your cabin doing?"

60
00:03:17.154 --> 00:03:17.834
Glen grinned.

61
00:03:17.854 --> 00:03:22.397
"I'm going to write a comedy routine for Ezra, Wes Wheezer, and me.

62
00:03:23.057 --> 00:03:24.818
I'm number one at writing comedy.

63
00:03:25.919 --> 00:03:27.980
So we're definitely going to win the prize."

64
00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:31.621
"As long as it's funny," Ezra said.

65
00:03:31.641 --> 00:03:35.622
"Trust me, it will be," Glen said.

66
00:03:35.642 --> 00:03:37.422
"Check out this joke.

67
00:03:37.842 --> 00:03:38.423
Knock, knock!"

68
00:03:38.443 --> 00:03:40.383
"Who's there?"

69
00:03:40.803 --> 00:03:41.463
Ezra asked.

70
00:03:41.483 --> 00:03:44.504
"Glen S.," Glen said.

71
00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:46.305
"Glen S.

72
00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:47.885
who?" Ezra asked.

73
00:03:47.905 --> 00:03:49.946
"Glen S.

74
00:03:50.026 --> 00:03:51.626
the funniest guy ever!"

75
00:03:53.687 --> 00:03:55.467
Glen laughed loudly.

76
00:03:56.247 --> 00:03:56.948
Ivy groaned.

77
00:03:59.341 --> 00:04:03.404
"That's the worst knock, knock joke ever!"

78
00:04:03.424 --> 00:04:08.328
Ezra panted as they started up a steep hill.

79
00:04:08.348 --> 00:04:12.632
"Ivy, you should just do an act with Clara and Willow.

80
00:04:13.392 --> 00:04:14.053
They're nice.

81
00:04:14.433 --> 00:04:16.195
And I bet the act will be good."

82
00:04:16.215 --> 00:04:21.079
"I don't like nice," Ivy said.

83
00:04:21.099 --> 00:04:23.701
"I like creepy and weird.

84
00:04:23.721 --> 00:04:27.084
That's why I'm friends with you two, remember?"

85
00:04:28.556 --> 00:04:29.337
Glen frowned.

86
00:04:29.357 --> 00:04:32.902
"I'm not—" "A painted lady!"

87
00:04:33.242 --> 00:04:34.043
Mango shouted.

88
00:04:34.584 --> 00:04:37.608
He stopped in his tracks and stared through his binoculars.

89
00:04:38.469 --> 00:04:40.872
Bam! The Ucks crashed right into him.

90
00:04:40.892 --> 00:04:43.215
"Ahh!" Mango yelled.

91
00:04:43.996 --> 00:04:46.679
Ivy stared in shock as Mango tumbled down the hill!
